/// key has been drawn but before any key byte is written. The observer must
/// see the complete non-zero key held through the abort cleanup and then
/// wiped before the first failure-report byte.
fn perm_failure_after_full_key_still_wipes_the_full_key(
    sup: &Support,
    bin: &Path,
    profile: &str,
    scenario: &str,
    fault_env: &str,
